e with it being in a vampire game either but it should be mentioned its a rare thing, and that there are dangers accompanying it and the tragedy that you will see them grow old and die...and then be all alone in the world, or turn them into your ghoul, never knowing if their affection for you is real or just the blood. or embracin them and seeing them change into somene you may hate. Tragedy is a big theme for vampires after all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4364,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4364-orkar","user":"Orkar","date":". 08-09-2020, 11:42 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4364-orkar","name":"Orkar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4364_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-09T09:08:15-07:00","id":1407146,"title":"","content":"I mean, maybe there are some desiccated stuck-up old elders who think romance and passion are bad things, but not all vampires (and defo not even all elders) think that way. Most vampires follow Humanity, and romantic love is a big part of being human.<br /> <br /> For that matter, I\u2019m not sure if the Path of Cathari is even a thing in V5 anymore, but I could totally see a Cathari Kindred being a serial monogamist. (Serial monogamy is still a form of romance.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]}]}